      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yep. I've had trouble for the past couple of months with friend requests and invite requests not coming through. Can't figure out if the issue is on my end or something on theirs. I've reported this twice now through support email and need to do more testing on my end as to some potential causes. \nEverything eventually makes it into the messages tab on the website but the majority of the time you don't get notified in game of the new messages, and waiting for it on the site can take days for it to show.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
